# Changelog (engine/v1/)

## Simulator obstacle/terrain support + AABB-derived platform/camera framing

- **What:** Added Obstacle and Terrain model previewing to the Engine Simulator, and made the preview disc platform footprint and DefaultCam framing (`distance` + `heightOffset`) derive from the loaded object's AABB, with the template's hardcoded disc size / camera distance / heightOffset treated as minimums (`Math.max`). Terrain now routes through `BuildTerrain` (role `"terrain"`) in `SpawnIntoScene` instead of the untagged `BuildObject` fallback; `DespawnFromScene` handles multi-part terrain (array targets) and dispatches on `objectType`. `SimulatorPayload` now resolves terrain template refs (via `normalizeObjectTemplateRef` with a `"terrain"`/`"obstacle"` collection selector) instead of dropping them. `Camera.js` gained an exported `SetDefaultCamFraming({distance, heightOffset})` so the simulator retargets framing at runtime without reaching into camera internals. `Simulator.js` `Load()` was reworked with `spawnPlatform()`/`frameLoadedObject()` helpers, `platformMesh` runtime tracking (invariantly an array), a `followTarget` recomputed from the loaded object's AABB center each load, and a `builtObject` that may be an array for multi-part terrain. `NewObstacle.js` exported its AABB-union helper as `MergeAabb` for reuse. `SpawnIntoScene`'s repeated post-spawn tail was collapsed into a `finalizeSpawn` helper. Also renamed pre-existing non-exported `FULL_CAPS` constants to `lowerCamelCase` in `math/Forces.js` (`airDragCoefficient`, `waterDragCoefficient`) and `handlers/game/Enemy.js` (`knockbackForce`, `invulnerabilityDuration`) per CASING.md.
- **Why:** The simulator only previewed entities/players cleanly — terrain hit an untagged-fallback bug and terrain template refs were discarded, while the platform and camera were fixed-size regardless of the loaded object. The `finalizeSpawn` extraction, `MergeAabb`/constant casing, and `objectType`-based despawn dispatch resolve duplication and rule (CASING, discriminator) findings raised by the post-implementation ERA/DRYAD audit.
- **Where:** `core/normalize.js` (`SimulatorPayload` terrain-ref branch); `builder/NewObstacle.js` (`MergeAabb` export); `handlers/game/Camera.js` (`SetDefaultCamFraming`); `handlers/game/Level.js` (`SpawnIntoScene` terrain branch + `finalizeSpawn`, `DespawnFromScene` array/objectType dispatch); `handlers/game/Simulator.js` (`Load` rework, `spawnPlatform`/`frameLoadedObject`, `platformMesh`); `math/Forces.js` and `handlers/game/Enemy.js` (constant casing).
